ne object literal. `policyItems` is currently unused but is a required, spec-driven parameter needed by upcoming tests (e.g., item-not-in-policy validation), so it was kept rather than removed and re-added next cycle.\n\n**Conclusion**: No net refactoring applied — original code remains the best version at this stage. This is documented rather than silently skipped, per the mandatory-attempt requirement (attempt was made, measured, and reverted for good reason).\n\n**Tests**: All passing (1 passed, 14 todo)."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-23-48_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_sonnet-5/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: computeClaimPayout(policyItems, incident, capBeforeClaim) now sums (damage.amount - DEDUCTIBLE) across all damages for the payout, and returns remainingCap = capBeforeClaim - payout. DEDUCTIBLE = 100.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run `NODE_ENV=development pnpm test claim` to verify (vitest requires devDependencies; NODE_ENV=production is set by default in this shell which skips installing them).\n\nRun autonomously, return when done. It's fine to conclude no refactoring needed at this early stage -- just document why.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: computeClaimPayout(policyItems, incident, capBeforeClaim) now sums (damage.amount - DEDUCTIBLE) across all damages for the payout, and returns remainingCap = capBeforeClaim - payout. DEDUCTIBLE = 100.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run `NODE_ENV=development pnpm test claim` to verify (vitest requires devDependencies; NODE_ENV=production is set b