s":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/scenario.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/scenario.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: Implemented runScenario(input) which processes a customer + steps array. For \"quote\" steps it calls computeQuotePremium(customer, items, true) and registers a new Policy (items + computeCap(items) as remainingCap) keyed by step index. For \"claim\" steps it looks up the policy by the referenced step index, calls computeClaimPayout(policy.items, incident, policy.remainingCap), updates the policy's remainingCap, and returns {payout, remainingCap}. Throws if the referenced policy step index isn't found.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run `NODE_ENV=development pnpm test scenario` to verify (vitest requires devDependencies; NODE_ENV=production is set by default in this shell which skips installing them).\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/scenario.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/scenario.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: Implemented runScenario(input) which processes a customer + steps array. For \"quote\" steps it calls computeQuotePremium(customer, items, true) and registers a new Policy (items + computeCap(items) as remainingCap) keyed by step index. For \"claim\" steps it looks up the policy by the referenced step index, calls computeClaimPayout(policy.items, incident, policy.remainingCap), updates the policy's remainingCap, and returns {payout, remainingCap}. Throws if the referenced policy step index isn't found.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run `NODE_ENV=development pnpm test scenario` to verify (vitest requires devDependencies; NODE_ENV=production is set by default in this shell which skips installing them).\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784915382696},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id